      "excerpt": "PKU BOYA Academy Chinese name: 博雅问渠书院 Brand Role PKU BOYA Academy is a learning and inquiry IP centered on liberal education, classical depth, and contemporary knowledge flow. Visual Direction Temperament: scholarly, clear, calm, rigorous, open. Color cues: academy blue, warm gold, paper white, soft stone grey. Imagery cues: reading rooms, flowing water, question marks, book margins, courtyards, knowledge maps. Agent",
      "text": "# PKU BOYA Academy\n\nChinese name: 博雅问渠书院\n\n## Brand Role\n\nPKU BOYA Academy is a learning and inquiry IP centered on liberal education, classical depth, and contemporary knowledge flow.\n\n## Visual Direction\n\n- Temperament: scholarly, clear, calm, rigorous, open.\n- Color cues: academy blue, warm gold, paper white, soft stone grey.\n- Imagery cues: reading rooms, flowing water, question marks, book margins, courtyards, knowledge maps.\n\n## Agent Notes\n\n- Use `博雅问渠书院` as the Chinese IP name.\n- Use `PKU BOYA Academy` as the English IP name.\n- Keep visual prompts refined and academic, avoiding overly decorative campus clichés.\n"
